### Variables
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@token = change-me-to-a-long-random-string

### Target Router Variables (Bisa diubah ke IP mana saja, e.g. 192.168.88.1)
@routerHost = 192.168.88.1
@routerPort = 8728
@routerUser = admin
@routerPass = password_anda

### 1. Health Check (Tanpa Auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1B. ⚡ Fast-Path Overview Snapshot (Sub-Millisecond Aggregation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Router-Host: {{routerHost}}
X-Router-Port: {{routerPort}}
X-Router-User: {{routerUser}}
X-Router-Pass: {{routerPass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 1C. 🌐 Unified Connected Devices & Cross-Layer Correlation Map
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/network/connected-devices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Router-Host: {{routerHost}}
X-Router-Port: {{routerPort}}
X-Router-User: {{routerUser}}
X-Router-Pass: {{routerPass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search": "",
  "filter_status": "all"
}

### 2. Universal System Resource (CPU, Uptime, Memory)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system/resource
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "router": {
    "host": "{{routerHost}}",
    "port": {{routerPort}},
    "user": "{{routerUser}}",
    "password": "{{routerPass}}"
  }
}

